classes.docu:
In BBj 7.00 and higher, a [BBjControl](https://documentation.basis.cloud/BASISHelp/WebHelp/bbjobjects/SysGui/bbjcontrol/BBjControl.htm)
implements the DragSource interface
if the user can specify drag actions and types.[Docs](https://documentation.basis.cloud/BASISHelp/WebHelp/bbjinterfaces/IF_DragSource/interface_dragsource.htm)

methods.docu:
In BBj 20 and higher, this method sets the
[BBjImage](https://documentation.basis.cloud/BASISHelp/WebHelp/bbjobjects/SysGui/bbjimagemanager/bbjimage/bbjimage.htm) to be used as the icon
for subsequent windows.[Docs](https://documentation.basis.cloud/BASISHelp/WebHelp/bbjobjects/SysGui/bbjimagemanager/BBjImageManager_setDefaultIcon.htm)

In BBj 18.00 and higher, this method returns a boolean to determine if
there is another [BBjGridCell](https://documentation.basis.cloud/BASISHelp/WebHelp/gridmethods/bbjgridcell/BBjGridCell.htm)
while iterating through the list in the container.[Docs](https://documentation.basis.cloud/BASISHelp/WebHelp/gridmethods/bbjgriddata/BBjGridData_hasNext.htm)

classes.docu:
In BBj 4.00 and higher, a [BBjControl](https://documentation.basis.cloud/BASISHelp/WebHelp/bbjobjects/SysGui/bbjcontrol/BBjControl.htm)
implements the Editable interface
if the user can edit the control via either the mouse or keyboard.[Docs](https://documentation.basis.cloud/BASISHelp/WebHelp/bbjinterfaces/IF_Editable/interface_editable.htm)

methods.docu:
In BBj 16.00
and higher, this method returns the color of text drawn to the [BBjDrawPanel](https://documentation.basis.cloud/BASISHelp/WebHelp/bbjobjects/Window/bbjdrawpanel/BBjDrawPanel.htm)
using [BBjDrawPanel::drawText](https://documentation.basis.cloud/BASISHelp/WebHelp/bbjobjects/Window/bbjdrawpanel/BBjDrawPanel_drawText.htm).[Docs](https://documentation.basis.cloud/BASISHelp/WebHelp/bbjobjects/Window/bbjdrawpanel/BBjDrawPanel_getTextColor.htm)

In BBj 16.00
and higher, this method sets the units
for positions and sizes on the [BBjDrawPanel](https://documentation.basis.cloud/BASISHelp/WebHelp/bbjobjects/Window/bbjdrawpanel/BBjDrawPanel.htm).[Docs](https://documentation.basis.cloud/BASISHelp/WebHelp/bbjobjects/Window/bbjdrawpanel/BBjDrawPanel_setDrawUnits.htm)
